# Each author's semantic annotation precedes the bar. The generator interprets only this annotation.
@club-mileage-boundary
plain sport gtmi|{sports} over {mi} miles
spoken sport gemi|{sports} of at least {mi} miles
plain sport ltmi|{sports} shorter than {mi} mi
spoken sport lemi|{sports} up to and including {mi} miles
spoken sport eqmi|{sports} exactly {mi} miles long

@home-state-visit
plain abbr|{abbr}
plain state|{state}
spoken sport state|{sports} that started in {state}
plain sport abbr|{sports} in {abbr}
spoken note|find notes containing "{note}"

@cross-state-namesakes
spoken twin sport|{sports} in {twin}
plain qualified sport|{sports} in {twin}, {twinabbr}
spoken qualified lastMonth|last month's workouts in {twin}, {twinstate}
spoken qualified fastest|my fastest workout starting in {twin}, {twinabbr}
spoken sport qualified noIntervals|{sports} in {twin}, {twinstate} excluding intervals

@moving-clock
spoken sport gtmin|which {sports} had over {minutes} minutes of active time?
spoken sport gemin|{sports} lasting at least {minutes} minutes, excluding paused time
plain sport ltmin|{sports} with under {minutes} moving minutes
spoken sport lemin|{sports} that took at most {minutes} minutes of active time
plain sport eqmin|{sports} with exactly {minutes} active minutes

@rollover-at-midnight
plain today sport|my {sports} today
plain yesterday sport|yesterday's {sports}
spoken lastMonth sport|{sports} from last calendar month
plain thisMonth sport|all my {sports} this month
spoken lastWeek sport|{sports} I recorded last week

@training-session-types
plain noIntervals sport|{sports} excluding intervals
plain intervals state|interval workouts from {state}
spoken noCoached city|workouts in {city} that weren't coached
spoken coached state|show coached workouts in {state}
spoken noIntervals abbr lastMonth|last month's workouts in {abbr} except intervals

@training-diary
spoken note sport|find my {sports} where I wrote "{note}" in the notes
spoken note thisMonth|my notes mentioned "{note}" this month
plain title lookup|workout titled "{title}"
spoken title lookup sport|my {singular} named "{title}"
spoken note state|workouts that started in {state} with "{note}" in my notes

@new-runner-no-history
spoken blank sport|do I have any {sports}?
spoken blank sport lastMonth|list my {sports} from the previous calendar month
spoken blank note|search my workout notes for {note}
plain blank state|have I logged workouts in {state}?
spoken blank sport longest|which of my {sports} went the farthest?

@weekend-route-repeats
plain longest sport|my longest {singular}
plain fastest sport|my fastest {singular} by average pace
spoken longest state|which workout covered the most distance in {state}?
spoken fastest city|fastest workout starting in {city}
spoken lastMonth sport longest|longest {singular} of last month

@metric-distance-goals
plain sport gtkm|{sports} longer than {km} kilometers
spoken sport gekm|{sports} of {km} km or more
plain sport ltkm|{sports} less than {km} km long
spoken sport lekm|{sports} no longer than {km} kilometers
plain sport eqkm|my {sports} measuring exactly {km} km

@vacation-starts
spoken city today|workouts I started in {city} today
spoken state yesterday|yesterday's workouts in {state}
spoken state lastWeek|show workouts starting in {state} last week
spoken city thisWeek|did I start a workout in {city} this week?
spoken sport city lastMonth|show last month's {sports} starting from {city}

@time-capped-training
plain sport gthr|{sports} longer than {hours} hours of moving time
spoken sport gehr|{sports} with at least {hours} hours of activity
spoken sport lthr|{sports} where I was moving for fewer than {hours} hours
spoken sport lehr|{sports} at or below {hours} active hours
spoken sport eqhr|{sports} with a moving time of exactly {hours} hours

@double-threshold-ride
plain sport gtmi lthr|{sports} over {mi} miles and under {hours} hours
spoken sport gemi lehr|{sports} covering at least {mi} miles in at most {hours} active hours
spoken sport gtmin ltkm|{sports} longer than {minutes} minutes but shorter than {km} km
spoken sport gtmin gtkm|{sports} over {minutes} minutes and over {km} kilometers
spoken sport lemin lekm|{sports} of at most {km} km and at most {minutes} minutes

@diary-lookup-by-trip
spoken title lookup city|workout in {city} with the title "{title}"
spoken title lookup lastMonth|find the workout called "{title}" from last month
spoken note noIntervals|look for "{note}" in notes on non-interval workouts
spoken note longest|longest workout with "{note}" in the notes
plain note fastest|fastest workout whose notes mention "{note}"

@coach-group-archive
plain sport intervals|interval {sports}
plain sport noCoached|all my {sports} except coached sessions
spoken state noIntervals|non-interval sessions starting in {state}
spoken coached city thisMonth|this month's coached sessions starting in {city}
spoken type longest|which of my {types} went farthest?

@reverse-chronology
plain sport newest|most recent {singular}
plain sport oldest|my first recorded {singular}
spoken city oldest|earliest workout from {city}
spoken note newest|most recent workout with a note about {note}
spoken type oldest|oldest of my {types}

@duration-and-region
spoken city gtmin|sessions from {city} longer than {minutes} moving minutes
spoken state lemin|workouts that started in {state} with active time up to {minutes} minutes
spoken sport abbr eqmin|{sports} in {abbr} at exactly {minutes} minutes active
spoken city gemin thisMonth|this month's {city} workouts with at least {minutes} active minutes
spoken city ltmin noIntervals|workouts from {city} under {minutes} minutes excluding intervals

@pace-and-geography
spoken sport fastest state|what was my fastest {singular} in {state}?
spoken sport longest state lastMonth|what was my longest {singular} in {state} last month?
plain sport fastest state lastMonth|fastest {singular} in {state} last month
spoken sport longest city noIntervals|among non-interval {sports} in {city}, which covered the most distance?
spoken sport fastest city thisMonth|speediest {singular} in {city} this month by average pace
